# Normalize all text files to LF in the working tree on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes CRLF
# files that fail `biome format` (default lineEnding "lf") and break the
# POSIX shell launchers. Index blobs are already LF, so this only affects
# checkouts. `text=auto` keeps binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
